    "text": "<p>We know that,</p><p>Converse of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi></math></p><p>So, using the above formula we get,</p><p>Converse of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>r</mi></math>&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8801;</mo><mo>~</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mtext>as</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>~</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8801;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p>",
